cartridge "SUNDOWN ROAD/AMY BIENVENU/2026"

' SUNDOWN ROAD - an original driving game for the ColecoVision.
'
' Pip has a little red car and a friend's birthday party to get to before
' the sun goes down: four legs of country road (the meadow, the pine
' forest, the lake, the hill). Gifts and flowers lie on the road to pick
' up; stumps and puddles lie there too. The sun is the clock.
'
' The road is drawn in perspective scanline by scanline (road.asm) into a
' hidden name page and a hidden set of tiles, then shown at once (two
' pages, two sets). The things beside and on the road are sprites at five
' sizes (things.asm places them). The drive is data (course.py).
'
' House rules: joystick and button only; text in columns 2-29, rows 1-22;
' tiles from code 128; an original tune played once; the NMI is off
' outside the wait.
'
' Controls: the button is the pedal; the stick steers (left, right) and
' brakes (down).

